  "Paste this prompt into a coding agent running in Libertty, such as Claude Code or Codex. It brings over your keybindings; themes, fonts and other settings stay as they are.": "把这段 prompt 粘贴给在 Libertty 里运行的编程 agent（如 Claude Code 或 Codex）。它会迁移你的快捷键；主题、字体和其他设置保持不变。",
